+
+# Record task createdAt and updatedAt
+
+- Every `Task` has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-time strings; equal when the task is added.
+- `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag` and `untag` set `updatedAt` to the time of the change; `createdAt` is kept.
+- The domain reads no clock (rule r3): `createTaskList` takes a `clock`; `createTodoList` defaults it to the system clock.
+- Tests in `test/list.test.ts` use a fixed clock.
